#: core/templates/core/partials/scene.html:1
msgid ""
"Une rue de quartier au soleil : café, galerie, théâtre et salle de concert, "
"restaurant, salon de thé, centre social, atelier d'art et hôpital, reliés "
"entre eux ; un nuage s'éloigne."
msgstr ""
"A neighborhood street in the sun: café, gallery, theater and concert hall, "
"restaurant, tea room, community center, art workshop and hospital, all "
"connected; a cloud drifts away."

#: core/templates/core/partials/scene.html:13
msgid "Café"
msgstr "Café"

#: core/templates/core/partials/scene.html:30
